#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:81
#: 399c0d9877b94de992348c54f3592101
msgid "To calibrate the sensor using Log file data please follow these steps:"
msgstr "要使用日志文件数据校准传感器，请按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:83
#: 187dea9dc8d741b6a76520ecd7bffb10
msgid ""
"Connect to your autopilot and ensure that logging while disarmed is enabled "
"by setting :ref:`LOG_DISARMED <copter:LOG_DISARMED>` to 1"
msgstr ""
"连接到飞控，通过将 :ref:`LOG_DISARMED <copter:LOG_DISARMED>` 设置为 1 确保已启用上锁状态下的日志记录"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:85
#: 6cc259380ed54260b64d2ea8c61d95f5
msgid ""
"Ensure the :ref:`FLOW_HGT_OVR <rover:FLOW_HGT_OVR>` parameter is set to the "
"height of the sensor above ground"
msgstr "确保 :ref:`FLOW_HGT_OVR <rover:FLOW_HGT_OVR>` 参数设置为传感器距地面的高度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:88
#: ca2d86ea397547b2875b46cef4e7a15a
msgid ""
"Find a location with a textured surface and good lighting (natural light or "
"strong incandescent)"
msgstr "找一个有纹理表面和良好光照（自然光或强白炽灯）的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:91
#: 1e0d5923f3de45af936704676c2afcda
msgid "Power on the vehicle"
msgstr "开启车辆电源"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:92
#: 2a63cae8a28340308082e9e2830d680c
msgid ""
"Rotate the vehicle (keeping it as close to the ground as practical) in roll "
"through a range from -15 to +15 degrees in about a second and then back "
"again. Repeat this 5 to 10 times. By closing one eye you will be able to "
"keep the centre of the sensor stationary against the background while you do"
" the rotation."
msgstr ""
"将车辆（尽量贴近地面）在横滚方向上从 -15 度到 +15 度旋转约一秒后再转回，重复 5 到 10 "
"次。闭上一只眼睛，可以在旋转过程中保持传感器中心相对背景静止。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:98
#: dc636a68da6143128dc25db517b2c86f
msgid "Repeat  about the vehicle pitch axis."
msgstr "绕俯仰轴重复上述操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:99
#: 7d90adc2c97e4ad9a076f7d24aa11706
msgid ""
"Download the data flash logs and plot the ``OF.flowX``, ``OF.bodyX`` and "
"``IMU.GyrX`` data. It should look something like this:"
msgstr ""
"下载 DataFlash 日志，绘制 ``OF.flowX``、``OF.bodyX`` 和 ``IMU.GyrX`` 数据。它应该看起来像这样："

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:105
#: a1ab6a38d17d46ce810a4d17f1013126
msgid ""
"If ``OF.flowX`` is larger or smaller than ``OF.bodyX``, then it can be "
"adjusted by changing the ``FLOW_FXSCALER`` parameter"
msgstr "如果 ``OF.flowX`` 大于或小于 ``OF.bodyX``，可以通过更改 ``FLOW_FXSCALER`` 参数进行调整"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:107
#: 333e0e1e965c4229bbfa9e8cb93e2e86
msgid ""
"IF ``OF.bodyX`` is uncorrelated or opposite sign to ``IMU.GyrX``, the "
":ref:`FLOW_ORIENT_YAW <copter:FLOW_ORIENT_YAW>` parameter is probably set "
"incorrectly or you do not have the flow sensor pointing downwards"
msgstr ""
"如果 ``OF.bodyX`` 与 ``IMU.GyrX`` 不相关或符号相反，则 :ref:`FLOW_ORIENT_YAW "
"<copter:FLOW_ORIENT_YAW>` 参数可能设置不正确，或者光流传感器未朝下"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:110
#: b4ce2706541f4b22b51e368500315b26
msgid ""
"Plot the ``OF.flowY``, ``OF.bodyYband``, ``IMU.GyrY`` data. It should look "
"something like this:"
msgstr "绘制 ``OF.flowY``、``OF.bodyYband``、``IMU.GyrY`` 数据。它应该看起来像这样："

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:116
#: 2c158f1574d84ed4a713e9966fadcf68
msgid ""
"If ``OF.flowY`` is larger or smaller than ``OF.bodyY``, then it can be "
"adjusted by changing the ``FLOW_FYSCALER`` parameter"
msgstr "如果 ``OF.flowY`` 大于或小于 ``OF.bodyY``，可以通过更改 ``FLOW_FYSCALER`` 参数进行调整"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:118
#: 24d39fb1518f4c7d9d23a539df310a0a
msgid ""
"IF ``OF.bodyY`` is uncorrelated or opposite sign to ``IMU.GyrY``, the "
":ref:`FLOW_ORIENT_YAW <copter:FLOW_ORIENT_YAW>` parameter is probably set "
"incorrectly or you do not have the flow sensor pointing downwards"
msgstr ""
"如果 ``OF.bodyY`` 与 ``IMU.GyrY`` 不相关或符号相反，则 :ref:`FLOW_ORIENT_YAW "
"<copter:FLOW_ORIENT_YAW>` 参数可能设置不正确，或者光流传感器未朝下"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:125
#: 307a6a4fe10249c9a3bb773e498248a4
msgid "Pre-Arm checks"
msgstr "解锁前检查"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:127
#: 050894f9d548439ea02312bee2031eff
msgid ""
"To allow arming and taking off in Loiter without a GPS the GPS arming check "
"should be turned off as shown below.  Unchecking \"All\" and \"GPS\" and "
"leave all other options checked."
msgstr ""
"要允许在没有 GPS 的情况下在 Loiter 中解锁和起飞，应关闭 GPS 解锁检查，如下所示。取消勾选「所有」和「GPS」，保留其他所有选项勾选。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:135
#: 3d10af3dd15e4c27ae1ed4288ff9b903
msgid "First Flight"
msgstr "首次飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:137
#: e653d64366db470cb47f0ea17e9f1f7e
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` = 0 (we don't want the optical "
"flow being used by the EKF at this stage)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` 设置为 0（在此阶段我们不希望 EKF 使用光流）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:138
#: c695b302aaf34c0f939c6a5af9c26723
msgid ""
"Perform a short test flight hovering in STABILIZE or AltHold for copter, or "
"QSTABILIZE or QHOVER for QuadPlane, at small lean angles at heights ranging "
"from 50cm to 3m with"
msgstr ""
"在 Stabilize 或 AltHold（多旋翼），或 QSTABILIZE 或 QHOVER（QuadPlane）模式下进行短暂测试飞行，在 "
"50cm 到 3m 高度范围内以小倾角悬停"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:139
#: 6bf582780ccc46d0a55f962ff63354a7
msgid "Download the flash log and plot the following in mission planner"
msgstr "下载 Flash 日志，在 Mission Planner 中绘制以下数据"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:140
#: cb30dd0c6de844a6a43e7efea0978b6a
msgid "EKF5.meaRng should correlate with the change in vehicle height"
msgstr "EKF5.meaRng 应与飞行器高度变化相关"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:141
#: 853151d575f942328b118bf918619b9f
msgid "``OF.flowX`` and ``OF.flowY`` should be varying"
msgstr "``OF.flowX`` 和 ``OF.flowY`` 应该在变化"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:142
#: d035cb0aa42b43d6be90152602ab1b4e
msgid ""
"``OF.bodyX`` and ``OF.bodyY`` should be consistent with IMU.GyrX and "
"IMU.GyrY"
msgstr "``OF.bodyX`` 和 ``OF.bodyY`` 应与 IMU.GyrX 和 IMU.GyrY 保持一致"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:145
#: 6d9031333aee418ea7ca68a3245ea2d2
msgid "Second Flight"
msgstr "第二次飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:149
#: ffbbb5d34ccc4f4fb36db2eaac7094ed
msgid ""
"You will need at least 15m of clear space around the vehicle to do this "
"flight safely. If the optical flow velocity estimates are bad, you will have"
" little warning and the copter may lean to its maximum lean angle very "
"quickly."
msgstr ""
"进行此飞行需要飞行器周围至少 15m 的空旷空间以确保安全。如果光流速度估计不准确，您将几乎没有预警，飞行器可能非常迅速地倾斜到最大倾斜角。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:152
#: 520bff3b4b544109ab11de560675975d
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` = 5 and :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY "
"<EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` = 0 to make the EKF ignore GPS and use the flow sensor"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` 设置为 5，:ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY "
"<EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` 设置为 0，使 EKF 忽略 GPS 而使用光流传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:153
#: ed33f20fbfc04e27bf3eb113587d191b
msgid "Ensure you have a loiter and hover mode available on you transmitter."
msgstr "确保遥控器上有 Loiter 和悬停模式可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:154
#: db7c4014e2b14832bcae2b3487523fb5
msgid ""
"Set \"EKF Origin\" on Ground Control Station map. In Mission Planner, right "
"click, select \"Set Home here\", and choose to set \"set EKF origin here\"."
msgstr ""
"在地面控制站地图上设置「EKF 原点」。在 Mission Planner 中，右键单击，选择「在此处设置 Home」，并选择「在此处设置 EKF "
"原点」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:155
#: 8689422f804a42dd9d58a0fc8c4fece2
msgid "Take-off in loiter and bring the Copter/QuadPlane to about 1m height"
msgstr "在 Loiter 模式下起飞，将多旋翼/QuadPlane 升至约 1m 高度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:156
#: 0cf0b1145f8a42dba046fc58a425f38b
msgid ""
"If the vehicle starts to accelerate away or there is erratic pitch or roll "
"movement, then switch to hover and land. You will need to download the log "
"file and share it on `the forums "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter>`__ to understand why."
msgstr ""
"如果飞行器开始加速远离或出现不规则的俯仰或横滚运动，请切换到悬停并降落。您需要下载日志文件并在 `论坛 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/arducopter>`__ 上分享以了解原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:159
#: 3b2c6726f0464b68a56336aeb49f4ed2
msgid ""
"If it holds location then congratulations, you have succeeded and can now "
"start experimenting with height changes and moving it around in the loiter "
"mode"
msgstr "如果飞行器能保持位置，则恭喜您成功，现在可以开始在 Loiter 模式下试验高度变化和移动了"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:163
#: f20a2c5224ce4245950a58892a964518
msgid "[/site]"
msgstr "[/site]"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:166
#: 80ab1375c5ab4057a4451c0804bce973
msgid "Setup for Normal Operation"
msgstr "正常操作设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:168
#: 60b4db65e6eb46c5bec5e428cf091eb5
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC_OPTIONS <EK3_SRC_OPTIONS>` = 0 to disable "
"FuseAllVelocities"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`EK3_SRC_OPTIONS <EK3_SRC_OPTIONS>` 设置为 0 以禁用 FuseAllVelocities"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:169
#: 45fe8f053f7a4e9f80998376bcb4461b
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_FLOW_DELAY <EK3_FLOW_DELAY>` depending on your optical flow "
"sensor"
msgstr "根据您的光流传感器设置 :ref:`EK3_FLOW_DELAY <EK3_FLOW_DELAY>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:170
#: c0ff8aaa011241c58a60e48856f452ce
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` = 3 (Primary horizontal position "
"from GPS, set this to 0 to only use the optical flow sensor)"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` 设置为 3（主水平位置来自 GPS，设置为 0 表示仅使用光流传感器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:171
#: 60c4a6662dbd43d28247fb5469c7541d
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` = 5 (Primary horizontal velocity "
"from OpticalFlow)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` 设置为 5（主水平速度来自光流）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:172
#: d259fecb4ea44ed497e7dce20c2b3692
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` = 1 (Primary vertical position from"
" barometer)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` 设置为 1（主垂直位置来自气压计）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:173
#: 46d858b7a1f24459b441120acafacc0f
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` = 0 (No primary vertical velocity "
"sensor)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` 设置为 0（无主垂直速度传感器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:174
#: 97558700f53d4f3ab70fa51e3dfafe8e
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 1 (Primary yaw/heading from "
"compass)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` 设置为 1（主偏航/航向来自罗盘）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:176
#: 4467f22057224da19514e2697982ef60
msgid ""
"Alternatively, GPS can work with OpticalFlow using EKF source switching."
msgstr "或者，GPS 可以通过 EKF 来源切换与光流协同工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-optical-flow-sensor-setup.rst:177
#: 286d1e2bc0ab46f6b25686de98b6b80f
msgid ""
"See :ref:`GPS / Non-GPS Transitions <common-non-gps-to-gps>` for information"
" on EKF source switching."
msgstr "关于 EKF 来源切换的信息，请参阅 :ref:`GPS / 非 GPS 切换 <common-non-gps-to-gps>`。"

